          "from": "Sanskrit सर्प (sarpá) 'snake, serpent'",
          "to": "sappa 'snake'",
          "note": "rp > pp; Wiktionary compares Maharastri Prakrit 𑀲𑀧𑁆𑀧."
        },
        {
          "from": "Sanskrit अर्पयति (arpáyati) 'causes to move; puts in or upon, fixes'",
          "to": "appeti 'to affix; to hand over'",
          "note": "Causative of the root ऋ (ṛ); the same rp > pp."
        }
